Bugfix: Store an empty file cache mimetype as unknown

A storage backend reporting an empty mimetype ('' or null) reached the
mimetype loader, which registered an empty string as a new mimetype (or failed
on the NOT NULL column for null) and stored a bogus mimepart. Empty mimetypes
are now stored as unknown (-1), like a mimetype of false already was.

https://github.com/owncloud/core/pull/41896
